# The container image is built FROM A RELEASE TARBALL (see packaging/Dockerfile),
# not from this source tree: the only thing the build context needs is `dist/`.
# Sending the rest — .git, target/, proofs/, bench-infra/ — would cost minutes
# per build for files no stage ever reads.
#
# `packaging/` is kept in the context so a future stage can COPY from it
# without this file turning that into a confusing "not found".
*
!dist
!dist/**
!packaging
!packaging/**
